Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "saroj_sunam",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Public Data Titles

### Get titles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/titles?page=0&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Get persons
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/persons?page=0&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Get genres
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/genres
Accept: application/json

### Search persons
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/persons?q=smith
Accept: application/json

